    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For a formal subclass of class 2 rules, measure perturbation cones, domain decomposition, and local temporal periods, then prove or test whether bounded communication implies bounded independent components and eventual periodicity. Counterexamples with persistent long-range dependence would refute the mechanism.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
